# --- Zone B: personal ledger. NEVER commit. --------------------------------
# PLAN.md §6.3: transactions, units, folios and PAN. Extreme sensitivity,
# encrypted at rest, "never leaves the device unencrypted". Nothing here exists
# yet — these entries are in place BEFORE the first real CAS is imported, not
# after, because a secret committed once stays in history.
/data/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
personal.db*
canonical.duckdb*

# CAS statements and anything derived from them
*.cas
*CAS*.pdf
/imports/
/quarantine/
/backups/

# A real CAS used as a local-only test fixture. `pdf.py` is the only module
# that touches a password, and it cannot be covered by a synthetic statement,
# so the test skips unless this directory holds one. Zone B: it carries a PAN,
# folio numbers and a postal address, and must never reach the repository.
tests/fixtures/local/

# --- Zone A: raw archive ---------------------------------------------------
# PLAN.md §4.4 archives every fetched byte permanently and content-hashed, but
# on disk under /data/raw — it is an archive, not source, and would be GBs.
/warehouse/

# --- config with real values -----------------------------------------------
# config/tax_rules.yaml is human-verified and belongs in the repo; anything
# carrying credentials or a real user id does not.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config/local.*
config/secrets.*

