Thumbs.db

# --- graphify output -------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable analysis artefacts, none of them tracked. The whole directory is
# ignored wherever it appears: it regenerates from the source it analysed, and
# its cache is keyed on mtime_ns so it churns on every file touch.
graphify-out/
**/graphify-out/

# --- the specification, local-only -----------------------------------------
# The 12,600-line spec and the decision log stay on this machine and off the
# remote. DECISIONS.md in particular recorded which funds this machine's owner
# holds — by name and ISIN — which is a statement about a person, not about
# the software. Purged from all 107 commits on 2026-09-14, not merely deleted
# at the tip, because a blob removed in a later commit stays fetchable.
docs/DECISIONS.md
docs/MODULE_0.md
docs/MODULE_1.md
docs/MODULE_2.md
docs/MODULE_3.md
docs/MODULE_4.md
docs/MODULE_5.md
docs/MODULE_6.md
docs/PLAN.md

# The public fund explorer, built by jobs/publish_site.py and published to
# the gh-pages branch -- never committed to main (DECISIONS V1-72).
/site/
